    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/0924db2eea3fbba869f2d41ca1988250.poster.avif?t=1746116281\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/0924db2eea3fbba869f2d41ca1988250.webm?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/0924db2eea3fbba869f2d41ca1988250.mp4?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join The league of the Hustlers, a group of revolutionaries, cheating card players, swordsmen and detectives.<br>A game that mixes classic adventure games with card tricks, duels and investigation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unveil a mystery of murder and conspiracy<br></li><li>Learn and master new card tricks<br></li><li>Be sneaky to infiltrate and find out information<br></li><li>Use logic to solve Point and Click Puzzles<br></li><li>If all else fails, fight them in a duel</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/500fc33e518dcdf72b0f17e7cac74e53.poster.avif?t=1746116281\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/500fc33e518dcdf72b0f17e7cac74e53.webm?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/500fc33e518dcdf72b0f17e7cac74e53.mp4?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/0924db2eea3fbba869f2d41ca1988250.poster.avif?t=1746116281\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/0924db2eea3fbba869f2d41ca1988250.webm?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/0924db2eea3fbba869f2d41ca1988250.mp4?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join The league of the Hustlers, a group of revolutionaries, cheating card players, swordsmen and detectives.<br>A game that mixes classic adventure games with card tricks, duels and investigation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unveil a mystery of murder and conspiracy<br></li><li>Learn and master new card tricks<br></li><li>Be sneaky to infiltrate and find out information<br></li><li>Use logic to solve Point and Click Puzzles<br></li><li>If all else fails, fight them in a duel</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/500fc33e518dcdf72b0f17e7cac74e53.poster.avif?t=1746116281\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/500fc33e518dcdf72b0f17e7cac74e53.webm?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971800/extras/500fc33e518dcdf72b0f17e7cac74e53.mp4?t=1746116281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
